# iCloud Drive conflict copies. This repo lives in iCloud-synced ~/Documents,
# and each build rewrites ~270 pages at once, which can make iCloud leave
# duplicates like "mn-21 2.html" or "topics 2/". Generated names never contain
# spaces, so "space + number" only ever matches these copies.
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9][0-9].*
